research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1479-[L4] Null geometric sequences: $|r| < 1$ implies $r^{k} \to 0$; and a constant multiple of a null sequence is null, while a constant sequence converges to that constant ([[lem-geometric-sequence-null]], [[thm-algebra-of-limits]], [[def-integer-power]], [[def-sequence]]).
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1480-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1481-[L5] Powers: $(2^{-1})^{k} = (2^{k})^{-1}$ for every $k \in \mathbb{N}$ ([[lem-power-laws]], [[def-integer-power]]).
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1482-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md:1483:[L6] Sequential criterion, the choice-free direction: if $f$ is continuous at $c$ and $x_k \in [a,b]$ with $x_k \to c$, then $f(x_k) \to f(c)$ ([[thm-sequential-criterion-for-continuity]], [[def-continuity-real]]).
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1484-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1485-[L7] Limits preserve non-strict inequalities ([[lem-limit-preserves-order]]).
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1486-
research/audit/wave8-refuter-tasks/ex-ivt-gives-nth-roots.md-1487-[L8] Order and field arithmetic in $\mathbb{R}$: trichotomy and totality, so exactly one of $f(m) \ge y$ and $f(m) < y$ holds; halving and the ordered-field identities ([[def-ordered-field]], [[def-complete-ordered-field]]); and $|t| \le s$ whenever $-s \le t \le s$ ([[lem-of-abs-value]]).
