research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-cantor-continuity-A4.log-311320- {"id":"cex-meager-set-of-full-measure","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"ai-altered","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://encyclopediaofmath.org/wiki/Meager_set"],"rationale":"The Encyclopedia of Mathematics states that a meager subset of the real line can have full Lebesgue measure and that residual null sets exist. The local proof constructs such a decomposition explicitly from interval covers of the rationals.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-cantor-continuity-A4.log-311321- {"id":"cex-cantor-point-that-is-not-an-endpoint","statement":"ai-generated","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"trivial","urls":[],"rationale":"This is a positive bespoke-witness determination: the item singles out one quarter rather than citing a named result. Its unique alternating 0,2 ternary sequence is not eventually constant, whereas every removed-gap endpoint has an eventually constant permitted expansion, so the witness is verified directly.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-cantor-continuity-A4.log-311322--{"id":"cex-irrationals-are-not-f-sigma","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://math.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Analysis/Book%3A_Mathematical_Analysis_%28Zakon%29/06%3A_Differentiation_on_E_and_Other_Normed_Linear_Spaces/6.08%3A_Baire_Categories._More_on_Linear_Maps/6.8.E%3A_Problems_on_Baire_Categories_and_Linear_Maps"],"rationale":"Zakon gives exactly that the rationals are not G-delta; complementation gives exactly that the irrationals are not F-sigma, while the same exercise records their residual G-delta form.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
