research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-cantor-continuity-A4.log-314059- {"id":"def-continuity-real","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"not-applicable","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://math.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Analysis/Mathematical_Analysis_%28Zakon%29/04%3A_Function_Limits_and_Continuity/4.01%3A_Basic_Definitions"],"rationale":"Zakon gives the same relative epsilon-delta definition on a subset. The local definition additionally packages the function-limit equivalence at limit points and the automatic isolated-point case.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
